# Nothing on the stick is looked up by its label (F174,
# docs/STICK-IDENTITY.md §5.2): faraday-grant finds the stick the machine
# started from by its layout and the build its boot partition holds. So
# the applets that find a filesystem by label or UUID are left out:
# findfs, which this board had on for that, and blkid and the volume_id
# reader beneath both, which Buildroot's default BusyBox has on.
# CONFIG_FINDFS is not set
# CONFIG_BLKID is not set
# CONFIG_VOLUMEID is not set
